cff-version: 1.2.0
title: HAIStack
message: If you use HAIStack or its research artefacts, please cite this software.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Degoke
    given-names: HAIStack contributors
repository-code: https://github.com/degoke/HAIStack
url: https://github.com/degoke/HAIStack
abstract: >-
  Modular Go libraries for FHIR-native health data infrastructure with
  policy-governed AI access, ViewDefinition analytics, terminology
  projections, and reproducible research artefacts (benchmarks, policy
  semantics, semantic conversion corpora, terminology evaluation, and
  FHIR-to-AI provenance pipelines). The source repository is
  https://github.com/degoke/HAIStack; the Go module path is
  github.com/degoke/haistack.
keywords:
  - FHIR
  - SMART on FHIR
  - SQL-on-FHIR
  - clinical AI
  - provenance
  - terminology
  - authorization
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-21"
